      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. To get more specific for my paper, could you look at how that framing plays out in actual practice? For example, if you compare a large-scale demonstration by a predominantly white group in a suburb over a new tax law versus a large-scale demonstration by a predominantly Black or minority group in a major city center over systemic issues, how does the media's vocabulary and tone usually differ between those two scenarios?",
